as que la tecnología DYNAWALLTM añade estabilidad a la sección de pies y talón durante los movimientos laterales. El protector de pie PGUARD TM proporciona seguridad adicional contra el desgaste excesivo. DYNAWRAP se integra con los cordones para crear estabilidad adicional cuando más lo necesita. El nuevo sistema DYNALACINGTM añade cuatro ojales adicionales en el lado lateral de cada zapato para ayudarle a conseguir un ajuste personalizado y bloqueado. Suela: Ort","sizes":["5","5.5","6","6.5","7","7.5","8","8.5","9","9.5","10","10.5","11","11.5","12"],"sizesTier":"scrape","sizesSource":"https://tennisexpress.com/products/women-s-gel-resolution-x-tennis-shoes-white-and-morganite","dept":"sporting_goods","retailer":"tennisexpress","url":"https://tennisexpress.com/products/women-s-gel-resolution-x-tennis-shoes-white-and-morganite"}],"women’s heavy lace halter tiered dress":[{"name":"Women’s Heavy Lace Halter Tiered Dress","brand":"Siena","price":188,"image":"https://slimages.macysassets.com/is/image/MCY/products/7/optimized/37575767_fpx.tif?wid=600&qlt=85&fmt=jpeg","images":["107|","55|6/optimized/37575766_fpx.tif?wid=600&qlt=85&fmt=jpeg","55|5/optimized/37575765_fpx.tif?wid=600&qlt=85&fmt=jpeg","55|3/optimized/37575763_fpx.tif?wid=600&qlt=85&fmt=jpeg","55|4/optimized/37575764_fpx.tif?wid=600&qlt=85&fmt=jpeg"],"description":"Vestido de mujer Siena, de encaje, halter y de capas.","sizes":["4"],"sizesTier":"scrape","sizesSource":"https://www.macys.com/shop/product/siena-womens-heavy-lace-halter-tiered-dress?ID=27278287","dept":"women","retailer":"macys","url":"https://www.macys.com/shop/product/siena-womens-heavy-lace-halter-tiered-dress?ID=27278287"}]}